  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Proposal to undertake an economic assessment of the current value of wildlife to Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of this study is to obtain a current understanding of the economic value of the trophy hunting industry in Tanzania. The information will be used to raise the awareness of the economic importance of the wildlife industry to Tanzania&apos;s national economy, especially to rural economies. The GOT and private sector will be encouraged to improve the long term sustainable conservation of wildlife through a better understanding and appreciation of its value and role.</narrative>
  </description>
